WEBVTT

00:09.175 --> 00:11.177
[foreboding music]

00:41.416 --> 00:43.418
[snarling]

01:21.414 --> 01:23.041
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

01:23.124 --> 01:24.417
[opening theme music]

02:21.432 --> 02:22.642
[snarls]

02:45.039 --> 02:46.332
[Ahn-hyeon] This plant...

02:46.416 --> 02:47.292
3 YEARS AGO

02:49.169 --> 02:51.337
...you're saying will resurrect the dead?

02:51.421 --> 02:52.255
[Cho Hak-ju] Correct.

02:52.964 --> 02:54.382
Immune to the sword,

02:55.258 --> 02:57.385
they transform into monsters

02:57.844 --> 02:59.637
that hunger for human flesh.

03:00.221 --> 03:02.515
Absurd. You can't bring the dead
back to life.

03:02.599 --> 03:03.808
[Cho Hak-ju] It is the truth.

03:05.143 --> 03:06.144
And if it is?

03:07.103 --> 03:09.397
For what reason
would you show this plant to me?

03:09.856 --> 03:12.525
Are you suggesting
we resurrect our fallen soldiers

03:12.609 --> 03:14.944
so they can continue fighting
the Japanese?

03:15.028 --> 03:16.112
[Cho Hak-ju] I am not.

03:16.696 --> 03:18.698
If the corpses started to rot,

03:19.073 --> 03:20.617
resurrection isn't possible.

03:21.326 --> 03:22.327
What's more,

03:22.410 --> 03:25.580
we cannot simply kill our soldiers
as sacrifice.

03:26.164 --> 03:28.458
Squandering our military is not an option.

03:32.170 --> 03:33.296
[sighs wearily]

03:34.672 --> 03:37.717
You still have not answered my question.
What are you trying to say?

03:38.927 --> 03:40.845
The sick people of Sumang...

03:43.598 --> 03:44.682
we'll use them.

03:47.477 --> 03:49.062
Turn them into monsters...

03:50.271 --> 03:52.690
and unleash them upon the Japanese army.

03:54.275 --> 03:55.944
That is how we survive.

03:59.405 --> 04:01.783
These are not animals on a farm,
these are people.

04:01.866 --> 04:03.534
And what purpose do they serve?

04:04.160 --> 04:05.787
They will be dead in due time.

04:06.788 --> 04:09.290
Our blood is the currency used
for this war.

04:10.208 --> 04:13.127
It is our sworn duty to guard the land
and our people.

04:13.878 --> 04:14.921
So then,

04:16.714 --> 04:18.591
you would break that oath

04:19.092 --> 04:20.927
and kill those you once protected.

04:23.596 --> 04:25.265
I will not take part in such crime.

04:28.810 --> 04:30.645
Resurrecting the dead?

04:30.728 --> 04:32.146
This is nonsense.

04:32.689 --> 04:34.941
Such a thing is not possible.

04:36.359 --> 04:37.944
[Cho Hak-ju] Tell me something.

04:38.695 --> 04:41.197
Is it the lowly commoner you fight for?

04:48.329 --> 04:50.081
I do not fight for them.

04:50.540 --> 04:52.125
I swore to defend...

04:53.126 --> 04:56.254
the royal family,
the keystone of this country.

04:57.255 --> 04:58.631
And I will do...

04:59.632 --> 05:01.634
what I must to not fail.

05:13.062 --> 05:14.105
[snarls]

05:19.027 --> 05:20.987
[snarls]

05:26.034 --> 05:28.953
Soon, countless Japanese soldiers
will descend upon us.

05:29.037 --> 05:31.080
Our 500 men will be no match.

05:31.748 --> 05:32.915
So, tell me.

05:33.333 --> 05:37.086
How long do you insist
on putting righteousness first...

05:38.671 --> 05:39.839
Lord Ahn?

05:43.885 --> 05:45.094
Sangju...

05:45.720 --> 05:48.097
Think of the many innocent
who are at risk.

05:49.891 --> 05:51.434
These dying souls...

05:52.685 --> 05:54.520
are a necessary sacrifice.

05:54.604 --> 05:56.439
[snarling]

05:56.773 --> 05:58.191
We can put an end to it...

05:59.525 --> 06:00.610
if the two of us...

06:01.694 --> 06:03.821
turn a blind eye just this once.

06:04.530 --> 06:06.491
[snarling]

06:10.620 --> 06:13.831
SUMANG VILLAGE

06:21.381 --> 06:22.840
[screaming]

06:25.385 --> 06:26.969
[whimpers]

06:27.804 --> 06:29.013
[man panting]

06:36.104 --> 06:38.022
[screams]

06:38.106 --> 06:39.357
[ragged breathing]

06:42.485 --> 06:45.071
[sorrowful music]

07:27.738 --> 07:30.366
[Cho Hak-ju]
Soon, the Japanese army will invade.

07:30.867 --> 07:33.035
Close the gate facing Sangju.

07:33.953 --> 07:35.788
The gate on the opposite side

07:36.414 --> 07:37.748
can remain open.

07:40.877 --> 07:43.171
[ominous music]

08:55.701 --> 09:00.122
[Ahn-hyeon]
I will not forget your sacrifices.

09:00.873 --> 09:03.709
I promise you, they will not be in vain.

09:04.210 --> 09:05.503
[snarling]

09:35.825 --> 09:37.451
[suspenseful music]

09:43.916 --> 09:45.001
[sighs]

09:49.255 --> 09:50.172
[whimpers]

09:54.135 --> 09:56.178
If you want to kill these undead monsters,

09:56.762 --> 09:58.639
focus your attacks on the head.

09:59.640 --> 10:00.516
[sighs]

10:02.810 --> 10:04.145
How is this possible?

10:04.687 --> 10:05.771
Lord Ahn...

10:07.690 --> 10:09.358
Lord Ahn Hyeon passed from his wounds.

10:09.734 --> 10:10.860
He was dead. I'm sure of it.

10:10.943 --> 10:12.111
He was.

10:13.946 --> 10:16.198
As you all witnessed with your own eyes,

10:16.699 --> 10:18.618
Lord Ahn had indeed died.

10:22.204 --> 10:24.540
However, that nurse
brought him back to life.

10:26.417 --> 10:27.710
As Cho Hak-ju has.

10:27.793 --> 10:29.795
He brought my father back from the dead.

10:32.340 --> 10:33.466
I ask you...

10:34.967 --> 10:36.761
tell us everything you know.

10:43.809 --> 10:47.104
Dr. Lee Seung-hui, the one who taught me,

10:47.688 --> 10:50.608
put his notes on the disease
in the King's patient journal.

10:57.698 --> 10:59.575
This is the resurrection plant.

11:00.034 --> 11:02.370
This is what I used to resurrect Lord Ahn.

11:02.703 --> 11:06.248
Also, this plant was used
to bring His Majesty back to life.

11:12.630 --> 11:15.257
[Lee Chang]
Patient journal, the one she speaks of.

11:16.676 --> 11:17.551
My father,

11:18.344 --> 11:20.012
he tried to tell the truth.

11:21.555 --> 11:23.099
The Haewon Cho Clan...

11:25.142 --> 11:26.977
and their leader, Cho Hak-ju,

11:27.311 --> 11:29.021
are accusing me of treason.

11:29.689 --> 11:32.191
They claim I'm after the throne.
These are lies!

11:34.360 --> 11:36.278
I have only one true desire:

11:37.738 --> 11:40.116
To see the Haewon Cho Clan punished...

11:41.283 --> 11:42.785
for destroying our nation.

11:48.499 --> 11:50.793
The Haewon Cho Clan
is guilty of mortal sin.

11:50.876 --> 11:53.003
You know that to protect their power,

11:53.963 --> 11:57.049
they defiled His Majesty's corpse
without even remorse.

11:57.675 --> 12:00.428
They oppress the people
still devastated by war.

12:01.303 --> 12:02.930
They are behind this famine.

12:04.181 --> 12:06.058
They deliberately starved the people.

12:06.559 --> 12:07.977
And now this plague.

12:08.477 --> 12:11.564
The Haewon Cho Clan's greed
is at the root of everything.

12:12.356 --> 12:14.692
Open your eyes and ears now!

12:17.445 --> 12:19.196
People of this land are suffering.

12:20.197 --> 12:21.991
Now is the time to rise up.

12:24.702 --> 12:26.036
Face reality...

12:28.539 --> 12:30.499
and do right by this country.

12:42.720 --> 12:44.513
Will you join this cause?

12:51.437 --> 12:52.605
- [distant thudding]
- [all gasp]

12:52.688 --> 12:56.358
THE CITADEL OF SANGJU

12:57.109 --> 12:58.110
[thudding continues]

12:59.445 --> 13:00.821
[foreboding music]

13:06.911 --> 13:08.788
[explosion]

13:09.830 --> 13:11.999
[infected screeching]

13:18.964 --> 13:21.175
[Lee Chang] The people inside the citadel

13:21.258 --> 13:22.968
cannot hold out much longer.

13:25.262 --> 13:27.181
We have to bring food as soon as we can.

13:27.264 --> 13:29.642
I agree,
but even with our most skilled soldiers,

13:29.725 --> 13:31.393
we cannot fight our way through that many.

13:31.477 --> 13:33.270
They greatly outnumber us.

13:36.732 --> 13:38.025
We escape through this canal.

13:39.193 --> 13:41.612
Using it,
we could send wagons of food back.

13:42.112 --> 13:43.489
I think that's our only chance.

13:43.948 --> 13:46.033
That area is one we know very well.

13:46.116 --> 13:47.368
Let us take the food.

13:48.619 --> 13:50.538
Our families are still in the citadel.

13:50.621 --> 13:51.872
Allow us to do it, please.

13:51.956 --> 13:53.541
They'll attack from all sides.

13:54.208 --> 13:55.292
Still think you can do it?

13:58.587 --> 14:00.130
If we take this route

14:00.923 --> 14:02.216
to the canal,

14:02.550 --> 14:04.218
and provide cover along the way...

14:04.301 --> 14:05.970
JUSEOMYEON, JUNAMMYEON

14:08.264 --> 14:09.640
...it could increase our odds.

14:09.723 --> 14:11.433
We could cover you
after you cross the river,

14:11.517 --> 14:14.311
but in the mountains,
you won't be visible to us anymore.

14:15.479 --> 14:18.274
How can we provide cover fire
if we can't see where you are?

14:22.278 --> 14:24.488
[tense music]

14:31.662 --> 14:33.372
- Fire now.
- [soldier] Fire!

14:58.480 --> 15:00.441
FIRE

15:16.373 --> 15:17.917
[cannon fire continues]

15:24.214 --> 15:25.466
Look! Over there!

15:25.925 --> 15:27.968
They are launching cannon fire
near the canal.

15:38.687 --> 15:40.189
Come on, everyone. Be quick.

15:40.272 --> 15:41.398
Come on. Hurry!

15:41.482 --> 15:43.567
[man 1] Oh, they've stopped fighting.

15:43.651 --> 15:44.902
[man 2] Move, quickly!

15:51.116 --> 15:52.534
[man 2 grunts wearily]

15:53.661 --> 15:54.662
[sighs]

15:54.745 --> 15:56.705
I don't understand. What is going on here?

15:56.789 --> 15:59.959
It's His Highness, the Prince.
He's taking Lord Cho Hak-ju down,

16:00.042 --> 16:01.585
and he's in control of Mungyeong Saejae.

16:01.669 --> 16:02.878
Oh, that's great news.

16:05.089 --> 16:07.424
His Highness regrets
that he could not be here.

16:07.591 --> 16:09.551
He must resolve a matter in Hanyang.

16:09.677 --> 16:11.553
However, I come bearing a message.

16:11.637 --> 16:14.974
It is not possible to get everyone
out of the citadel safely

16:15.057 --> 16:16.183
as we are still outnumbered.

16:16.266 --> 16:21.021
So, we will continue to bring you food
using this method from time to time.

16:21.146 --> 16:23.691
So please stay here
and hold out as long as you can.

16:23.774 --> 16:25.317
[indistinct chatter]

16:25.401 --> 16:27.319
[children giggling]

16:28.862 --> 16:30.489
[man] Come on, give me a hand with this.

16:31.407 --> 16:34.159
THE BASE CAMP IN MUNGYEONG SAEJAE

16:42.918 --> 16:43.752
How is he doing?

16:45.004 --> 16:47.089
His body temperature keeps dropping.

16:49.216 --> 16:50.259
Hmm.

16:50.968 --> 16:54.054
But you are sure that my uncle
will not turn into one of those monsters?

16:54.138 --> 16:56.974
I'm reasonably certain
that he will not turn.

16:57.057 --> 16:59.351
Besides, not everyone
turns into a monster.

17:00.394 --> 17:01.729
Like Dan-i.

17:01.812 --> 17:03.439
He was bitten by the King,

17:03.522 --> 17:05.149
and he never turned into one.

17:06.775 --> 17:10.404
However, he did become bedridden
and die eventually.

17:12.239 --> 17:13.741
The disease has changed.

17:14.116 --> 17:16.910
Dongnae, Jiyulheon happened differently.

17:17.453 --> 17:20.664
It was the ones who ate Dan-i's flesh
that became monsters.

17:21.415 --> 17:24.168
They spread the disease afterwards.

17:24.251 --> 17:25.961
Then, uh...

17:26.336 --> 17:28.464
Then, what will the disease do
to my uncle?

17:29.798 --> 17:31.925
While he may not fall prey to it,

17:32.551 --> 17:34.678
he'll probably die from the symptoms,

17:35.179 --> 17:36.472
just as Dan-i had.

17:36.847 --> 17:38.140
We have to treat him somehow.

17:42.436 --> 17:44.772
Seo-bi, please save his life.

17:45.939 --> 17:49.401
I know what he's done to His Majesty
is unforgivable,

17:49.735 --> 17:52.321
but we cannot let him die
in such a horrible way.

17:52.404 --> 17:53.322
Dan-i...

17:54.156 --> 17:56.450
there was nothing I could do to help him.

17:58.744 --> 18:00.537
This time has to be different.

18:02.623 --> 18:05.667
If I cure him
and find out what causes the symptoms,

18:06.251 --> 18:08.670
maybe I will find a way
to bring this plague under control

18:08.754 --> 18:09.630
once and for all.

18:10.214 --> 18:13.467
All right. Just whatever you do,
please save my uncle's life.

18:16.220 --> 18:18.097
His body temperature has dropped again.

18:18.180 --> 18:20.891
We must warm his body.
Look around for any herbs that could help.

18:20.974 --> 18:22.976
Sure. Okay. I can do that.

18:25.270 --> 18:27.397
[breathing anxiously]

18:28.023 --> 18:29.608
Seo-bi. Seo-bi, wait.

18:29.942 --> 18:31.068
Would this work?

18:31.151 --> 18:33.612
This is a rare medicinal wood
that the Queen asked for.

18:34.905 --> 18:36.281
Sappanwood?

18:36.365 --> 18:39.451
It's used to treat
gynecological conditions and ailments.

18:39.910 --> 18:42.454
Lord Cho would not benefit from this,
unfortunately.

18:42.538 --> 18:43.497
[Beom-pal sighs]

18:47.876 --> 18:48.919
[Seo-bi] Wait.

18:50.796 --> 18:51.880
Did you...

18:52.714 --> 18:55.425
say Her Majesty asked for this herb?

18:57.386 --> 19:00.180
This couldn't be
for Her Majesty herself, could it?

19:00.264 --> 19:01.807
Of course it's for Her Majesty.

19:01.890 --> 19:04.017
Why else would I have worked so hard
to get it?

19:06.186 --> 19:08.272
You mean the Queen herself used this?

19:09.898 --> 19:11.733
No. That cannot be.

19:15.863 --> 19:18.282
Did the Queen use it recently?

19:20.117 --> 19:21.827
Is that really important right now?

19:22.202 --> 19:23.829
My uncle has one foot in his grave.

19:23.912 --> 19:25.414
Please, you must tell me.

19:26.540 --> 19:27.583
[sighs]

19:27.666 --> 19:29.835
I had to get this wood last month
and the month before.

19:32.421 --> 19:33.672
What's wrong?

19:39.928 --> 19:41.096
- [door opens]
- [both gasp]

19:41.180 --> 19:42.264
[horses galloping]

19:42.347 --> 19:43.557
[soldier 1] Yah! Yah!

19:44.766 --> 19:45.684
Yah!

19:49.188 --> 19:50.189
[soldier 2] Your Highness.

19:51.356 --> 19:52.733
We have a problem.

19:57.279 --> 19:58.405
[Lee Gang-yun] What happened?

19:58.864 --> 20:00.616
Where are the soldiers who were on guard?

20:00.908 --> 20:03.785
They were killed.
We found their bodies behind the building.

20:03.869 --> 20:04.995
Who did this?

20:06.288 --> 20:07.581
Tell me right now!

20:09.041 --> 20:11.376
[soldier 2] I was informed
that Your Highness' personal guard

20:11.460 --> 20:13.045
passed the three gates with a carriage.

20:13.128 --> 20:15.714
He said he was carrying out an order
by His Highness.

20:17.674 --> 20:19.593
[tense music]

20:25.682 --> 20:27.768
[panting]

20:35.609 --> 20:36.610
Yah!

20:42.032 --> 20:43.492
[woman] What is this place?

20:45.786 --> 20:49.539
His Majesty collapsed just a few days ago
due to smallpox.

20:50.040 --> 20:52.251
The palace is in total chaos right now.

20:53.502 --> 20:56.421
Unfortunately, I must work.
I cannot stay at your side.

20:56.755 --> 21:00.092
And I worry about leaving you alone
since you're so close to giving birth.

21:01.009 --> 21:03.637
This residence belongs
to an acquaintance of mine.

21:04.263 --> 21:06.181
In just a few days, I will return for you.

21:06.765 --> 21:08.225
If I am to wait here,

21:08.892 --> 21:10.894
then who will take care of you
when you come home?

21:10.978 --> 21:13.772
Even if it's only for a few hours,
who will cook your meals?

21:14.356 --> 21:15.399
Please.

21:15.732 --> 21:18.193
I want to stay with you, where I belong.

21:24.157 --> 21:27.619
I will never understand what I did
to deserve such a loving wife.

21:27.703 --> 21:31.999
Especially when you suffer
with a husband as foolish as I am.

21:34.584 --> 21:35.627
[sighs]

21:36.753 --> 21:37.796
I'm sorry.

21:39.381 --> 21:40.716
You know I truly am.

21:44.428 --> 21:45.971
I'll wait for you, then.

21:47.431 --> 21:49.433
And there is no need to worry about me.

21:52.477 --> 21:54.062
It will only be a few days.

21:54.896 --> 21:56.732
So, please look after yourself

21:56.815 --> 21:58.191
and wait for my return.

22:00.360 --> 22:01.778
[inhales deeply]

22:13.915 --> 22:15.042
Take her to the room.

22:15.834 --> 22:17.294
This way, please.

22:18.754 --> 22:21.048
[poignant music]

22:38.815 --> 22:40.692
[Beom-il] You made a wise decision.

22:41.735 --> 22:44.404
I'm truly glad
you brought her here yourself.

22:45.364 --> 22:47.657
Now you know your wife is in good hands.

22:48.617 --> 22:50.619
And we are getting what we want.

22:54.331 --> 22:55.248
If anything...

22:56.166 --> 22:58.752
untoward happens to my wife
while she's here,

23:01.004 --> 23:02.297
I will not...

23:04.216 --> 23:05.926
I will not stand idly by.

23:11.473 --> 23:14.226
Know your place.
You have no right to threaten.

23:17.646 --> 23:21.149
Shall I grab your wife by her hair
and drag her here?

23:22.067 --> 23:24.361
And end her life before your eyes?

23:26.947 --> 23:29.324
I understand the Crown Prince
is very fond of you,

23:29.408 --> 23:33.412
but the Haewon Cho Clan
will not be threatened by a mere guard.

23:35.205 --> 23:37.374
I need to know
where the Crown Prince goes,

23:37.958 --> 23:39.668
and with who he meets.

23:40.168 --> 23:41.420
Understand?

23:42.129 --> 23:43.505
That's the only...

23:44.423 --> 23:47.968
way your family's safety will be ensured.

23:50.095 --> 23:51.513
[sighs]

24:17.873 --> 24:18.915
[sighs]

24:22.961 --> 24:24.171
Yah!

24:26.798 --> 24:27.841
Yah!

24:33.847 --> 24:34.764
Yah!

24:37.434 --> 24:39.769
It has already been four hours
since they left.

24:39.853 --> 24:42.439
Even though they are burdened,
they must be very far by now.

24:42.522 --> 24:44.149
If Cho Hak-ju reaches Hanyang first,

24:44.232 --> 24:46.276
he will return with the might
of the Five Armies.

24:46.359 --> 24:48.278
The people are still scarred
by the last war.

24:48.361 --> 24:49.905
We cannot let our country implode again.

24:49.988 --> 24:51.364
But how will you catch him?

24:51.448 --> 24:53.825
There are many routes
he could have taken to get to Hanyang.

24:55.035 --> 24:56.203
I am a tiger hunter.

24:56.578 --> 24:59.456
No one is better at chasing targets.
Allow me to join you.

25:01.583 --> 25:02.626
[Lee Chang] Yah!

25:02.709 --> 25:04.586
- Yah!
- [Yeong-sin] Yah!

25:04.669 --> 25:05.754
[Lee Chang] Yah!

25:07.339 --> 25:09.299
Yah! Yah!

25:10.425 --> 25:12.385
[tense music]

25:18.350 --> 25:19.643
Is anyone outside?

25:19.726 --> 25:20.727
HANYANG CONFERENCE HALL

25:20.810 --> 25:22.354
Why have we still not received word?

25:24.523 --> 25:27.484
Lord, we have not heard any news
from the Queen's Palace yet.

25:27.567 --> 25:30.570
But Her Majesty's labor pains
began hours ago!

25:31.029 --> 25:33.281
What if something has gone wrong?
Have you considered that?

25:33.365 --> 25:36.368
Stop making such a fuss and sit down.
Just have patience.

25:36.451 --> 25:38.036
I cannot tolerate this nuisance.

25:42.541 --> 25:43.625
Councilors,

25:44.084 --> 25:46.086
are you not at all curious, though?

25:46.461 --> 25:50.465
His Majesty was falling in and out
of consciousness due to the plague.

25:51.216 --> 25:55.762
So why would the Chief State Councilor
take His Majesty to Mungyeong Saejae?

25:56.638 --> 25:58.515
That is not important right now.

25:58.848 --> 26:00.183
The only thing that matters

26:00.267 --> 26:03.103
is whether or not we can restore
the backbone of this kingdom.

26:04.020 --> 26:04.896
[sighs]

26:07.190 --> 26:10.151
[woman breathing anxiously, whimpering]

26:15.949 --> 26:17.158
[groans]

26:18.743 --> 26:20.620
[screams]

26:21.121 --> 26:23.582
[man] Who ordered the killings
of the women and children?

26:25.250 --> 26:26.835
[woman] How dare you!

26:27.294 --> 26:30.380
You dare to suspect Her Majesty?

26:31.089 --> 26:35.093
The moment Her Majesty learns
about this betrayal,

26:35.760 --> 26:36.803
you...

26:37.512 --> 26:40.473
will face our Queen's wrath!

26:40.724 --> 26:42.976
[breathing shakily, groaning]

26:43.059 --> 26:45.186
Are you keeping a close watch
on the Queen's Palace?

26:46.062 --> 26:47.105
Yes, sir.

26:47.439 --> 26:50.025
We are monitoring everyone,
from the court ladies

26:50.108 --> 26:52.360
to the court maids,
even the water maids are being tracked.

26:52.777 --> 26:54.029
[panting]
Sir.

26:56.364 --> 26:58.575
I was just informed
of something very strange,

26:58.908 --> 27:01.202
from the people
who lent palanquins to Naeseonjae.

27:01.870 --> 27:04.122
It seems that there were more, actually.

27:04.205 --> 27:06.499
Six palanquins, not three last night.

27:09.294 --> 27:11.379
[ominous music]

27:17.719 --> 27:19.429
What can we do for you?

27:20.180 --> 27:22.682
I am here to search
the servants' quarters. It is urgent.

27:22.766 --> 27:25.268
We cannot let anyone
enter these grounds at the moment.

27:25.852 --> 27:28.688
Surely the servants' quarters
cannot be off limits.

27:29.481 --> 27:31.650
We are looking for evidence
of a serious crime.

27:33.109 --> 27:34.319
Step aside.

27:55.340 --> 27:56.758
[woman] What is the meaning of this?

27:59.135 --> 28:01.513
Her Majesty
is in the middle of childbirth.

28:02.055 --> 28:04.474
You dare make a scene?
This will not go unpunished.

28:04.557 --> 28:07.894
The guards in the East Gate informed us
at around 10 p.m. last night,

28:08.353 --> 28:11.564
they saw three palanquins
entering the Queen's private residence.

28:11.648 --> 28:13.942
Wet nurses came to breastfeed the baby.

28:14.275 --> 28:16.403
- That's not a crime, is it?
- Of course not.

28:16.486 --> 28:18.113
The guards also mentioned

28:18.196 --> 28:21.616
these palanquins entered the residence
without being questioned who was inside.

28:22.867 --> 28:25.453
You instructed the guards not to ask,
but I must know.

28:25.537 --> 28:28.123
And I already told you,
it was the wet nurses.

28:28.206 --> 28:29.332
Step aside.

28:52.564 --> 28:54.149
[man] Pray tell, what on earth happened?

28:54.232 --> 28:56.276
We arrested him at the Queen's Palace.

28:56.359 --> 28:58.111
He had entered
the Office of Royal Delivery.

28:58.194 --> 29:00.947
You dare barge into the Queen's Palace,

29:01.030 --> 29:03.199
knowing full well
that Her Majesty is in labor?

29:03.616 --> 29:06.703
Not even a king can enter
the Office of Royal Delivery.

29:06.786 --> 29:10.123
I understand that you are the head
of the Royal Commandery Division,

29:10.206 --> 29:12.834
but this is a serious offense
that will not go unpunished.

29:13.710 --> 29:16.087
They arrested the head
of the Royal Commandery.

29:16.171 --> 29:18.548
The soldiers investigating Naeseonjae
have left.

29:19.340 --> 29:20.592
That matter is done.

29:20.675 --> 29:21.926
[chuckles]

29:30.268 --> 29:32.187
They dare to get in my way?

29:32.854 --> 29:35.523
Those Royal Commandery rats
are as good as dead.

29:35.940 --> 29:37.358
[court lady] It's as I said.

29:37.984 --> 29:40.153
No one can outsmart Your Majesty.

29:40.737 --> 29:42.906
Now that they have lost their power,

29:42.989 --> 29:45.200
the Royal Commandery is finished as well.

29:45.283 --> 29:46.576
No one stands in your way.

29:49.913 --> 29:50.830
So then,

29:51.915 --> 29:52.957
what of the baby?

29:53.041 --> 29:56.711
The remaining pregnant women
have been sent back to Naeseonjae.

29:57.128 --> 30:01.758
I... believe they can expect
very good news soon.

30:05.929 --> 30:06.805
[Seo-bi groans]

30:10.767 --> 30:13.269
Hey, sir!
We have to stop right now, please!

30:17.273 --> 30:18.399
Sir!

30:18.817 --> 30:20.735
Please, his condition is worsening.

30:21.402 --> 30:22.320
Sir!

30:23.321 --> 30:25.448
- [grunts]
- [horse neighs]

30:26.908 --> 30:28.618
[sighs]
His body is ice-cold.

30:28.701 --> 30:30.578
I could barely feel his pulse.

30:32.413 --> 30:33.748
How much longer will he last?

30:34.749 --> 30:37.126
Well, at this rate, he will die very soon.

30:40.255 --> 30:43.007
Please, good sir,
we must find a place to lie him down.

31:04.153 --> 31:05.113
[stammering]
Wait...

31:05.196 --> 31:06.030
Wait, Seo-bi.

31:11.953 --> 31:13.079
[groans]

31:15.039 --> 31:16.124
Uh...

31:17.584 --> 31:19.961
[mumbling]

32:09.886 --> 32:11.220
[horses trotting]

32:13.181 --> 32:15.183
I'm certain they went that way.

32:15.808 --> 32:17.352
It's the only route to Hanyang.

32:17.894 --> 32:19.812
So we should be able to catch them now.

32:19.896 --> 32:21.814
[panting]

32:25.902 --> 32:27.236
Why did you do nothing?

32:30.365 --> 32:31.950
Your Highness, he betrayed you.

32:33.242 --> 32:34.869
And you knew it just as well.

32:40.541 --> 32:42.502
I wasn't ready to lose anyone else.

32:45.338 --> 32:46.339
That's why.

32:48.883 --> 32:50.259
I wanted to trust him.

32:51.094 --> 32:53.221
[sorrowful music]

33:06.150 --> 33:07.193
[Seo-bi] Excuse me, sir.

33:08.194 --> 33:10.905
Do you know when His Highness will arrive?

33:10.989 --> 33:13.366
You said he would follow
behind us shortly.

33:19.247 --> 33:20.540
How is Lord Cho?

33:20.999 --> 33:25.086
His condition is stable for now. However,
he does not seem to be doing well.

33:25.962 --> 33:28.673
If it's safe here, we should continue
to wait for His Highness.

33:32.135 --> 33:33.636
No, we have to leave now.

33:33.720 --> 33:34.679
Gather His Lord.

33:35.638 --> 33:37.223
Tell me the truth.

33:38.099 --> 33:40.435
Prince Chang did not request we leave,
did he?

33:43.521 --> 33:46.733
And you have no intention of waiting
for His Highness to catch us?

33:47.358 --> 33:49.318
I know not why you are acting this way,

33:51.821 --> 33:53.531
but I implore you to reconsider.

33:54.615 --> 33:57.076
I could tell His Highness
is very fond of you.

33:57.160 --> 33:58.244
He relies on you as well.

33:59.579 --> 34:02.999
So, I thought you made it your duty
to keep His Highness safe.

34:06.753 --> 34:08.296
I told you we're leaving.

34:08.755 --> 34:10.214
No. I will not go.

34:10.548 --> 34:12.884
There is something important
I must tell the Prince.

34:16.554 --> 34:19.974
Look, this is sappanwood,
a tree that only grows in Japan.

34:20.224 --> 34:23.478
It's medicinal.
It's very rare and expensive to procure.

34:24.062 --> 34:26.147
- What of it?
- Traditionally...

34:26.731 --> 34:29.567
it is used to remove blood clots
after a miscarriage or birth,

34:29.650 --> 34:33.321
or to alleviate symptoms related
to improper or lack of postpartum care.

34:33.654 --> 34:35.364
This medicine is very strong.

34:36.032 --> 34:38.493
Women who are pregnant
should not be using it at all.

34:38.576 --> 34:40.787
I have no time for this.
What are you trying to say?

34:40.870 --> 34:42.121
The Queen...

34:43.039 --> 34:45.083
I know Her Majesty is using sappanwood.

34:45.917 --> 34:47.627
What do you mean "Her Majesty"?

34:48.294 --> 34:50.630
You just said that it cannot be taken
while carrying a child.

34:50.713 --> 34:53.966
Exactly. The Queen cannot be taking this
if she is still pregnant,

34:54.050 --> 34:55.718
but the magistrate told me that she is.

34:56.135 --> 34:57.428
Then he must be mistaken.

34:57.512 --> 35:01.724
Sir, I am as confused as you are.
However, if what he says is true,

35:02.850 --> 35:05.353
then we have to tell His Highness
as soon as we can.

35:05.686 --> 35:09.190
And if Her Majesty is truly taking this,
we must find out why that is.

35:14.904 --> 35:16.280
- [woman 1] Wait.
- [woman 2] Eh?

35:16.364 --> 35:18.491
- [woman 1] Are you sure you're done?
- [woman 2] Uh-huh.

35:18.574 --> 35:20.493
[chuckles]

35:23.121 --> 35:25.206
[foreboding music]

35:50.356 --> 35:51.357
Did you say...

35:52.900 --> 35:55.444
it's taken after birth or miscarriage?

35:56.112 --> 35:57.321
Normally, yes.

36:00.158 --> 36:01.159
[coughing]

36:06.581 --> 36:08.082
[coughing]

36:10.585 --> 36:12.211
My Lord, are you all right?

36:14.463 --> 36:16.048
[groggily]
Where are we?

36:17.466 --> 36:18.718
I want answers.

36:19.218 --> 36:20.303
What is this?

36:20.970 --> 36:22.388
What is it used for?

36:24.223 --> 36:25.808
I'm not sure.

36:25.892 --> 36:28.728
Naeseonjae boarded several women
late in pregnancy.

36:29.979 --> 36:31.314
Why were they gathered there?

36:33.774 --> 36:36.527
What are you scheming
with those women at Naeseonjae?

36:38.613 --> 36:40.072
You will tell me right now.

36:47.246 --> 36:48.206
[horses neigh]

36:57.924 --> 36:59.342
[menacing music]

37:16.651 --> 37:17.860
Escort Lord Cho! Quickly!

37:17.944 --> 37:18.903
Yes, sir!

37:55.940 --> 37:57.858
[Seo-bi, distraught] Sir!

38:02.029 --> 38:03.114
[gasps]

38:07.743 --> 38:09.912
[sorrowful music]

38:13.457 --> 38:14.792
[stammering]
Seo-bi,

38:16.210 --> 38:17.211
the thing is...

38:17.837 --> 38:21.257
I didn't have a choice.
My uncle told me to do this.

38:33.811 --> 38:35.646
Seo-bi, we have to go.

38:36.272 --> 38:38.816
If you refuse, he will kill you as well.

38:41.694 --> 38:43.029
[weakly]
Go now.

38:46.615 --> 38:47.533
Go...

38:51.412 --> 38:53.748
Find out at all cost.

39:01.630 --> 39:02.965
Go now.

39:06.677 --> 39:07.762
Hurry.

39:34.121 --> 39:35.664
[woman whimpering]

39:35.748 --> 39:39.043
[muffled scream]

39:41.879 --> 39:43.798
[muffled groaning]

39:48.260 --> 39:49.678
[muffled grunt]

39:51.722 --> 39:55.309
[muffled agonized groan]

39:56.435 --> 39:58.562
[poignant music]

40:36.934 --> 40:38.477
[echoing] Mu-yeong!

40:41.605 --> 40:43.023
Mu-yeong...

40:44.817 --> 40:45.776
Mu-yeong!

40:53.617 --> 40:54.785
[weakly]
Sir...

40:57.413 --> 40:58.664
Sir...

41:00.332 --> 41:01.625
[sniffles]

41:03.085 --> 41:04.378
Sir...

41:05.921 --> 41:07.882
I'm sorry, sir.

41:09.467 --> 41:11.802
Your Highness, I'm sorry...

41:12.052 --> 41:13.012
[Lee Chang sniffles]

41:13.387 --> 41:15.514
...for all my foolishness.

41:19.560 --> 41:21.312
[yelling]
I need help, hurry!

41:22.313 --> 41:24.273
Please, someone help him right now!

41:31.697 --> 41:33.324
Naeseonjae...

41:34.366 --> 41:36.785
There are many pregnant women there.

41:37.286 --> 41:38.537
The Queen...

41:39.246 --> 41:41.999
and her court are plotting something.

41:43.042 --> 41:44.210
The nurse...

41:45.544 --> 41:47.963
The nurse knows everything.

41:51.383 --> 41:52.843
Naeseonjae...

41:55.554 --> 41:57.681
My wife is there as well.

41:58.349 --> 42:01.227
[muffled cry]

42:08.359 --> 42:09.693
Family...

42:11.946 --> 42:13.697
My family is there.

42:18.577 --> 42:20.204
Your Highness...

42:23.874 --> 42:25.459
I'm sorry.

42:27.795 --> 42:31.090
I'm sorry for failing to protect you...

42:33.217 --> 42:34.802
to the very end.

42:39.890 --> 42:42.268
[Lee Chang sobbing]

42:43.018 --> 42:44.395
[Lee Chang] Mu-yeong.

42:45.062 --> 42:48.649
[sobbing]
Mu-yeong...

42:56.991 --> 42:58.284
Mu-yeong.

43:07.751 --> 43:09.044
Mu-yeong.

43:24.310 --> 43:27.229
[baby wailing]

43:27.730 --> 43:29.732
[foreboding music]

43:31.734 --> 43:32.860
[cooing]

43:45.706 --> 43:46.957
[baby coos]

44:34.797 --> 44:36.882
[closing theme music]
